{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40859","headline":"永州陪郑太守登舟夜宴席上各赋诗 · 蒋肱","name":"永州陪郑太守登舟夜宴席上各赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江头朱绂间青衿，岂是仙舟不可寻。\n谁敢强登徐稚榻，自怜还学谢安吟。\n月凝兰櫂轻风起，妓劝金罍尽醉斟。\n剪尽蜡红人未觉，归时城郭晓烟深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋肱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}